	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10118"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=775" title="View the profile of Roadie">Roadie</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 2<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=775"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1014.msg10118#msg10118"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1014.msg10118#msg10118">Re: Guess that Guild</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #8 on:</b> August 16, 2004, 05:11:51 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Lets play &quot;Guess that Guild&quot; game. What guild removes posts from their forums?  You cant even say goodbye to your guild mates. So moving on, or moving up in the world is taboo. Saying something so negative in a post like  &quot; so long my friends its been fun&quot;  are removed faster than you can log off for the night.  When the guild leader was asked why posts are removed before the membership gets to read them the short answer was, &quot;we don&#039;t need no negativity around here. Well that&#039;s sure a funny way of getting rid of negativity. Its called censorship. Oh well, the ones who&#039;s post&#039;s were removed know the answer to this weeks game. Until next week when &quot;Guess that Guild&quot; goes another round, here&#039;s another clue for next week.  What guild has lost (or driven away) more members to ROS than any other?<br />Later. <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm39.gif" alt="cwm39" border="0" /><br /><br />(Last weeks answer was : Union of Power) You guys are good!
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
