								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=233"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.geocities.com/lutikruss" title="" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:lutikruss@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1014.msg10127#msg10127"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1014.msg10127#msg10127">Re: Guess that Guild</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #10 on:</b> August 17, 2004, 12:22:40 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							who needs good bye posts anyway? sure I made one when I left my former guild but it&#039;s not like it has to sit there on the boards just because I took the time to write one.&nbsp; The guild know&#039;s you left, those involved know why you left, so just leave it at that and move on with your life.&nbsp; Seems you are the one with the problem.&nbsp; Keep the friends you made and just move on&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />.
