							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I like games <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" />, but I don&#039;t like to cause trouble with former guilds so I&#039;ll stay clear of this one&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm1.gif" alt="cwm1" border="0" />
